[{"id":3425650496,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM0MjU2NTA0OTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/issues/events/3425650496","actor":{"login":"cln-m4rie","id":16286987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjg2OTg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16286987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie","html_url":"https://github.com/cln-m4rie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cln-m4rie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-06-09T15:55:11Z","label":{"name":"bug","color":"ee0701"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/issues/comments/641408844","html_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/issues/1621#issuecomment-641408844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/issues/1621","id":641408844,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0MTQwODg0NA==","user":{"login":"StephenBrown2","id":1148665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg2NjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1148665?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2","html_url":"https://github.com/StephenBrown2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-06-09T16:15:26Z","updated_at":"2020-06-09T16:15:26Z","body":"That's a perfectly fine choice, IMHO. Another option is to make a custom root type, i.e. `Position`, which will give you the ability to do even more with it:\r\n\r\n```pycon\r\nfrom typing import List\r\n\r\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, validator\r\n\r\nclass Position(BaseModel):\r\n    __root__: List[int]\r\n\r\n\t# Note: everything in this class that follows is optional\r\n\t# Docs: https://pydantic-docs.helpmanual.io/usage/models/#custom-root-types\r\n    @property\r\n    def x(self):\r\n        return self.__root__[0]\r\n\r\n    @property\r\n    def y(self):\r\n        return self.__root__[1]\r\n\r\n    @property\r\n    def z(self):\r\n        return self.__root__[2]\r\n\r\n    @property\r\n    def t(self):\r\n        return self.__root__[3]\r\n\r\n    def __len__(self):\r\n        return len(self.__root__)\r\n\r\n    def __iter__(self):\r\n        return iter(self.__root__)\r\n\r\n    def __getitem__(self, item):\r\n        return self.__root__[item]\r\n\r\nclass PositionData(BaseModel):\r\n    positions: List[Position]\r\n\r\n    @validator(\"positions\", each_item=True)\r\n    def is_quadrangle_positions(cls, v):\r\n        if isinstance(v, Position):\r\n            if len(v.__root__) != 4:\r\n                raise ValueError(\"positions list is not quadrangle\")\r\n        elif isinstance(v, list):\r\n            if len(v) != 4:\r\n                raise ValueError(\"positions list is not quadrangle\")\r\n        else:\r\n            raise ValueError(\"positions is not a list\")\r\n        return v\r\n\r\n\r\ntest_data = {\r\n    \"positions\": [\r\n        [0, 0, 3, 3],\r\n        [3, 3, 6, 6],\r\n    ]\r\n}\r\n\r\ndata = PositionData.parse_obj(test_data)\r\n\r\ndata\r\n> PositionData(positions=[Position(__root__=[0, 0, 3, 3]), Position(__root__=[3, 3, 6, 6])])\r\ndata.positions[0].z\r\n> 3\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/issues/comments/641408844/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"StephenBrown2","id":1148665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg2NjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1148665?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2","html_url":"https://github.com/StephenBrown2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StephenBrown2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/issues/comments/641417391","html_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/issues/1621#issuecomment-641417391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic